Subject: [PATCH] test(dsv41): trace sequence-parallel target rows

Keep the bounded accuracy diagnostic aligned with rank-local prefill rows while retaining replicated decode positions. This diagnostic commit is newly implemented and AI-assisted on top of the imported Christopher Owen/vLLM build baseline; it is not a claim of upstream authorship.
